# Pub mirror (Runflare)

Always use the **Runflare** mirror for `flutter` / `dart pub` in this repo. **Do not** use `pub-azs.ir` or other mirrors unless the user explicitly overrides.

## Env (before any flutter/dart command)

```bash
source tool/pub_env.sh
```

Defaults (forced — overrides shell pub-azs or other mirrors):

- `PUB_HOSTED_URL=https://mirror-flutter.runflare.com`
- `FLUTTER_STORAGE_BASE_URL=https://mirror-gcs.runflare.com`

## Agents & scripts

- `./tool/ci_verify.sh` sources `tool/pub_env.sh` automatically.
- CI sets the same vars in `.github/workflows/ci.yml`.
- After `pub get`, `pubspec.lock` hosted URLs should be `mirror-flutter.runflare.com`.

## Do not

- Switch mirrors to pub-azs or pub.dev without user request.
- Commit machine-specific mirror config that overrides Runflare for the whole team.
